"P4001767950" "I've noticed something troubling, {HeroName}, and I hope you can help me get to the bottom of it. After encounters with the Devouring Earth, several of my heroes have been expressing sympathy for the creatures' goal of reverting the planet to nature. It just doesn't seem normal. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go to a Devouring Earth cave and see if you can find out what's causing my heroes' strange new attitudes.</A> But be careful; I don't want to lose you, too!"
// AcceptString :
"P4124904100" "Go to a Devouring Earth cave and see if you can find out what's causing the heroes' strange new attitudes"
