"P3398217606" "You failed to defeat the villains before significant damage was done to the Fleet Sports Drink warehouse."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2297265088" "This sports drink you found certainly does look strange; I'd bet my house the DATA techs will find it's contaminated with the Devouring Earth's mutagenic mold. And I think I know why. I did some digging and traced Fleet Sports Drink to a group of eco-terrorists known as the Free Earth Coalition. I think the Devouring Earth was supplying them with this mold, and they were willingly gearing up to distribute it among the population. I guess the armies of Nemesis found that plan objectionable. I can't say that I blame them."
// RandomFameString :
"P1098628379" "{HeroName} stopped Fleet Sports Drink from poisoning us all!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3622429161" "I did some digging and traced Fleet Sports Drink to a group of eco-terrorists known as the Free Earth Coalition. My guess is that the Devouring Earth were supplying them with some sort of mutagen to slip into their products. Luckily, Nemesis uncovered the plot before Fleet was able to distribute their product. I can't condone their violent methods, but I'm glad they helped us prevent a catastrophe."
// RandomFameString :
"P2438227920" "Did you hear Fleet Sports Drink was working with the Devouring Earth? From now on it's water for me!"

