// Dialog :
"P2520530796" "You failed to get the gassing victims to the hospital in time. Despite the stabilizing agent, some of the stockbrokers were mutated."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P482800589" "I've seen the Devouring Earth's manifesto before, but I guess I never thought they'd attack people just because of their jobs. I guess I shouldn't have underestimated their fanaticism. One thing I can say about that manifesto; it wasn't written by a big pile of rocks or crystal. There's an intelligent mind behind the Devouring Earth somewhere. If we ever hope to defeat them for good, we'll have to find out who this Hamidon is."
// RandomFameString :
"P3927993281" "{HeroName} saved my stockbroker from the Devouring Earth!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1012866471" "The affected victims have been hospitalized, but I don't know how long it will be before the medics find a cure. But I know they won't stop until they do. Don't beat yourself up over this, {HeroName}. You did your best, and there's still hope for those people."
// RandomFameString :
"P1811183205" "My stockbroker turned into some kind of lizard. Guess I'm taking my business to Wall Street from now on!"

