// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P654239342" "Yes! Hamidon knows all!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3479415455" "You die today!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostages 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P79172519" "Researcher"
// Description :
"P538892161" "researchers to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1281507579" "Save the last researcher!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P4227070835" "You saved me, {Rescuer}! They would have killed me for sure!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4074912449" "You found a strange packet of organic material on one of the creatures. You call your contact and receive instructions to take it to Jenny Firkins, the hazardous technology expert."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_DevouringE_Compound1_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1360712715" "Talk to Jenny Firkins"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3397953632" "Has Jenny seen that stuff you found? She can probably tell us a lot about it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P675250733" "You never stop us!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1398060238" "Die in pain!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P196951389" "New weapon will eat you alive!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1702594037" "This substance you found may look like a moldy pita pocket, but it's one of the most insidious weapons I've ever seen. It's a neat little packet of cancerous tissue, combined with a catalyst that will force the disease to multiply rapidly in any human host. Of course, without a delivery system, it's totally harmless. I don't see any way for the Devouring Earth to infect a person with this, short of force-feeding it to them. No, what they need is some sort of syringe or other injection system, something to get this tissue directly into the bloodstream. Oh. Oh, no.<br><br>There was a Devouring Earth raid on Lawson Pharmaceuticals this morning. Quick, organized, and destructive. {ContactName} probably would have sent you, but you were already engaged over at ZenTech. I'm beginning to think the ZenTech attack was just a distraction, to keep you occupied while they got what they needed from Lawson Pharmaceuticals. Unless I miss my guess, the Devouring Earth is hard at work producing a stockpile of weapons that can destroy our citizens from the inside out!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_DevouringE_Compound1_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3539380353" "Shut down weapons production"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P615700924" "If the Devouring Earth starts using those weapons, hundreds of innocents may die! You've no time to waste!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2862466739" "The walls of this cave are spattered with a thick, green mold. You can't explain why, but you have the sensation of someone watching you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P80017446" "Is weapon ready?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3892956980" "Soon, soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3899565115" "You are the disease!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2327673076" "Soon, the humans will suffer for their crimes."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1287216414" "You will not win"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Machine 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1607199223" "Weapons lab"
// Description :
"P1835498735" "labs to destroy"
// SingularDescription :
"P113635380" "Destroy the last lab!"
// InteractBeginString :
"P2480784153" "You begin to destroy the weapons lab."
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3677832921" "You have destroyed the weapons lab."
// InteractActionString :
"P3365161279" "Destroying..."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2450541692" "You stopped the Devouring Earth from producing their cancer-causing weapons."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4260357746" "In a sick way, it's almost poetic. The Devouring Earth view us as a cancer upon the world, so they tried to use cancer to wipe us out. I can't tell you how grateful the city is to you, {HeroName}. You may very well have saved every life in Paragon City."
// RandomFameString :
"P1590051593" "Did you hear the news? {HeroName} saved us all from some sort of sick new weapon!"

