// Clue Name :
"P3658083799" "List of Names"
// DetailString :
"P4083374825" "This list contains the names of many of the most talented scientists in Paragon City. At the end of the list is a drawing of a cave mouth with some discernable landmarks nearby."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - BiologistStory 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2547859909" "The biologist's story"
// DetailString :
"P50387322" "When you rescued Warren Applegate, he told you:<br><br>'They said I might be smart enough to be their new progenitor, whatever the heck that is. They also said they would take me and the other candidates to Hamidon shortly. I don't know who these candidates are, but I think you're their only hope.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P245529532" "{HeroName}, I really need your help this time. One of my best friends, Warren Hale, was kidnapped this morning! The police said his apartment was a shambles; the only clue they could come up with was some green mold that had spread over the walls. I'm certain the Devouring Earth is behind this. Will you help me, {HeroName}? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You're the only one I can trust to rescue my friend from the Devouring Earth!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3849509961" "Rescue {ContactName}'s friend from the Devouring Earth"
// SendOffString :
"P2043934443" "Warren's a biologist. Maybe the Devouring Earth want to force him to help with one of their mutagenic attacks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_DevouringE_Compound2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2130455447" "Save Warren from Devouring Earth"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2714818919" "Please, help my friend Warren. If you can't do it, I don't know who to turn to."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3463765864" "You can't stop thinking about the worried look on {ContactName}'s face. You'll rescue Warren Hale, or die trying."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - VILLAIN_GROUP 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1957383648" "Will he be the next First One?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2035593723" "Hamidon shall choose."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3977512242" "Kill, kill, kill!"

