"P2420884454" "You rescued Warren Hale."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1473634906" "You defeated the Devouring Earth and rescued Warren Hale."

