// Variable - BOSS_DISPLAYNAME 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_VILLAIN 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2754085578" "These humans will give us new life!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Variable - BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2749898247" "Die, {HeroName}! Die in my grasp!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P1334112634" "Hostage"
// Description :
"P1644728217" "people to save"
// SingularDescription :
"P1374389461" "Save the last person!"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P794582654" "They said I could be their future, {Rescuer}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3947175672" "What do they mean by 'progenitor?'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3420731466" "I don't want to be changed!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2836392507" "{Rescuer}! What a relief! I thought I was a goner!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1757991209" "You rescued the kidnapped people from the Devouring Earth."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2364827705" "I can't thank you enough for getting Warren back safe and sound. You may consider me eternally in your debt. I don't know exactly what the Devouring Earth hoped to get from him. I'm just grateful they didn't change him, as they've changed so many others."
// RandomFameString :
"P1427189537" "Did you hear that {HeroName} saved a bunch of big shot scientists from the Devouring Earth?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_DevouringE_Errand1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P349645399" "The folks over in Founders' Falls think they may have to pave over Hutchinson Park. The area over there is so green and lush, it's become a magnet for Devouring Earth creatures. I think I've got another solution to their problem. I want you to head over to Founders' Falls and defeat as many Devouring Earth minions as you can find. If we can convince the Devouring Earth that Founders' Falls isn't the place for them, maybe it won't have to be turned into a parking lot."
// AcceptString :
"P2419066103" "Go to Founders' Falls and defeat as many Devouring Earth minions as you can find"
// SendOffString :
"P3878619244" "Hutchinson Park is a beautiful place; I'd hate to see it covered in asphalt."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2274699691" "Battle DE in Founders' Falls"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P217151714" "There are still Devouring Earth creatures roaming free in Founders' Falls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2107224784" "You have discouraged the Devouring Earth from frequenting Hutchinson Park in Founders' Falls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1521252588" "Well done, {HeroName}! You know, one of my best friends got married in Hutchinson Park. I'm sure she'll be delighted to know that you've saved it from becoming a concrete hole."
// RandomFameString :
"P2015646053" "The city council dropped the plans to pave Hutchinson Park! Boy, was I happy to hear that!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_DevouringE_Errand2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P4238143063" "There's a big problem in Crey's Folly that I think you can take care of. Every time we turn our back on the Paragon Water Works, the Devouring Earth is in there, trying to add some sort of poison or mutagen. It's getting to the point where people don't feel safe drinking the city's water. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to go to Crey's Folly and convince the Devouring Earth that it's not their personal playground.</A> Make sure they know that we won't tolerate any further incursions."
// AcceptString :
"P2999375570" "Go to Crey's Folly and convince the Devouring Earth it's not their personal playground"
// SendOffString :
"P1512553629" "Have you ever tried showering in bottled water? It's not cheap."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4233074031" "Battle DE in Crey's Folly"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2495010140" "I'm still getting reports about Devouring Earth creatures in Crey's Folly. Back to the streets you go."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P208656151" "You discouraged the Devouring Earth from meddling with the water works in Crey's Folly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2659195389" "I'll get Channel 6 to do a report on your efforts today. That way we'll get the word out that the water is safe; plus, you deserve a moment in the spotlight. Good work."
// RandomFameString :
"P2025165083" "Did you see the news? {HeroName} is working to keep our water safe!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL7_DevouringE_Errand3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3125062440" "The Devouring Earth have been steadily growing into an incredible threat, {HeroName}, and they're getting more dangerous every day. It's vital to the safety of the city that heroes constantly fight back against the menace of the Devouring Earth. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I'd like you to concentrate your efforts against the Devouring Earth for a while, battling them wherever they appear.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3251963617" "Battle the creatures of the Devouring Earth wherever you can"
// SendOffString :
"P3861647073" "The Devouring Earth can be found in many parts of the City, {HeroName}, but you might want to concentrate your battle against them to Eden and Crey's Folly. Few other heroes can survive in those perilous areas, so heroes of your power level are always needed to battle the Devouring Earth there."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1806311919" "Combat Devouring Earth menace"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1242828675" "You need to defeat more of the Devouring Earth's creatures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1438838468" "You have defeated enough Devouring Earth creatures."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P564482169" "Public confidence always rises when the people of the city see a major hero like you fighting menaces like the Devouring Earth."
// RandomFameString :
"P2573630613" "Those Devouring Earth creatures better head for the hills! {HeroName}'s on the job!"

