"P3524028768" "{HeroName}, I really need your help this time. One of my best friends, Warren Hale, was kidnapped this morning! The police said his apartment was a shambles; the only clue they could come up with was some green mold that had spread over the walls. I've tracked Warren's pager to a nature preserve that recently fell into the Devouring Earth's hands, and I used some of my pull to get an emergency force field put in place. Will you help me, {HeroName}? <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You're the only one I can trust to rescue my friend from the Devouring Earth!</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P1273251244" "Rescue friend of {ContactName} from the Devouring Earth"

